OL,3,GNEWSAReservoir progress too slow -
OL,4,AGreen deputy leader
OL,5,
OL,6,FWater companies, the industry regulator
OL,7,Fand the government are not moving fast
OL,8,Fenough to build a new reservoir to
OL,9,Fsupply drinking water, according to the
OL,10,Fdeputy leader of the Green Party.
OL,12,FRachel Millward said there had been a
OL,13,F"woeful lack of investment in essential
OL,14,Finfrastructure", which she said was a
OL,15,F"problem of privatisation".
OL,17,FA new reservoir is being planned in the
OL,18,FCambridgeshire Fens but Anglian Water
OL,19,F(AW) has said it would be operational
OL,20,F"10 years from now".
